{"seq":2,"slug":"currency-number-formatting","title":"货币与数字格式化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/currency-number-formatting","wordCount":1556,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"货币与数字格式化\">货币与数字格式化</h1><p>金融数据的国际化是后端系统中精度要求最高的领域。同一个数值 <code>1234567.89</code> 在不同 locale 下的显示差异巨大——美国写作 <code>1,234,567.89</code>，德国写作 <code>1.234.567,89</code>，印度写作 <code>12,34,567.89</code>。后端的职责是存储精确值、传输无歧义表示、在输出层按 locale 格式化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>最小单位整数存储</strong>：金额存为 minor units 的 bigint（如 10000 分 = $100.00），杜绝浮点精度问题</li>\n<li><strong>币种伴随金额</strong>：脱离 ISO 4217 币种代码的金额是无意义的，两者必须成对出现</li>\n<li><strong>银行家舍入</strong>：HALF_EVEN 是金融标准舍入模式，大量计算的累计误差趋近零</li>\n<li><strong>API 传输用字符串或整数</strong>：JSON float 的 53 位精度不足以无损表示所有金额</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"货币存储-最小单位整数\">货币存储：最小单位整数</h2><p>浮点运算在金融场景中是一个已知的灾难源：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0.30000000000000004</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>IEEE 754 double</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1 + 0.2 = 0.30000000000000004 \\quad (\\text{IEEE 754 double})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.30000000000000004</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IEEE 754 double</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>后端存储货币金额的正确方式是<strong>最小货币单位的整数</strong>（minor units）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>货币</th>\n<th>ISO 4217 代码</th>\n<th>小数位 (minor units)</th>\n<th>¥100.00 的存储值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美元</td>\n<td>USD</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>10000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日元</td>\n<td>JPY</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>巴林第纳尔</td>\n<td>BHD</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>100000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>比特币</td>\n<td>BTC (XBT)</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>10000000000</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 货币数据的存储结构&#10;interface MonetaryAmount {&#10;  amount: bigint; // 最小单位整数，绝不是浮点&#10;  currency: string; // ISO 4217 三字母代码&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 正确：存 10000 分 = $100.00&#10;const price: MonetaryAmount = { amount: 10000n, currency: &#39;USD&#39; };&#10;&#10;// 错误：浮点存储 → 累计误差&#10;const bad = { amount: 100.0, currency: &#39;USD&#39; }; // 潜在精度丢失\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 货币数据的存储结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MonetaryAmount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bigint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最小单位整数，绝不是浮点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ISO 4217 三字母代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：存 10000 分 = $100.00</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MonetaryAmount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, currency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：浮点存储 → 累计误差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bad</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, currency: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 潜在精度丢失</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每种货币的 minor units 数量由 ISO 4217 定义，CLDR 数据中也有对应映射。后端在做货币转换时，必须查询目标货币的 minor units 来正确缩放：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>display_value</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>stored_minor_units</mtext><msup><mn>10</mn><mtext>decimal_digits</mtext></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{display\\_value} = \\frac{\\text{stored\\_minor\\_units}}{10^{\\text{decimal\\_digits}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">display_value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0953em;vertical-align:-0.7009em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2991em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8109em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0248em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decimal_digits</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">stored_minor_units</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7009em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"多币种系统的数据模型\">多币种系统的数据模型</h2><p>跨境业务需要存储多种货币并支持转换。关键设计决策：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Transaction Record] --&gt; B[&quot;amount_minor: 15000&lt;br/&gt;currency: EUR&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;exchange_rate: 1.0842&lt;br/&gt;rate_timestamp: 2026-07-18T12:00Z&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;settlement_amount: 16263&lt;br/&gt;settlement_currency: USD&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[Transaction Record] --&gt; B[\"amount_minor: 15000&lt;br/&gt;currency: EUR\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"exchange_rate: 1.0842&lt;br/&gt;rate_timestamp: 2026-07-18T12:00Z\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"settlement_amount: 16263&lt;br/&gt;settlement_currency: USD\"]</pre><p><strong>不要实时转换替代存储原始值</strong>。正确的做法是同时存储：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>原始金额 + 原始币种（交易发生时的事实）</li>\n<li>使用的汇率 + 汇率时间戳（可追溯性）</li>\n<li>结算金额 + 结算币种（财务记录）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>汇率的精度要求通常高于金额本身。外汇市场报价精度到小数点后 4-5 位（pip），某些货币对到 6 位。存储汇率建议使用 <code>DECIMAL(20, 10)</code> 或等效精度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数字格式化的-locale-差异\">数字格式化的 locale 差异</h2><p>数字格式化涉及三个 locale 敏感的符号：分组分隔符、小数分隔符和负号位置。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Locale</th>\n<th>1234567.89 的显示</th>\n<th>分组符</th>\n<th>小数符</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>en-US</td>\n<td>1,234,567.89</td>\n<td>,</td>\n<td>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>de-DE</td>\n<td>1.234.567,89</td>\n<td>.</td>\n<td>,</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fr-FR</td>\n<td>1 234 567,89</td>\n<td>(空格)</td>\n<td>,</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>hi-IN</td>\n<td>12,34,567.89</td>\n<td>, (非等距)</td>\n<td>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ar-EG</td>\n<td>١٬٢٣٤٬٥٦٧٫٨٩</td>\n<td>٬</td>\n<td>٫</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>印度数字系统的分组规则特别复杂——最后三位一组，之后每两位一组（lakh = 1,00,000、crore = 1,00,00,000）。阿拉伯语使用东阿拉伯数字（٠-٩）且可能是从右到左。</p>\n<p><strong>后端格式化的时机</strong>：大多数场景下，后端 API 返回原始数值，由客户端负责 locale 格式化。但以下场景需要后端格式化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>邮件/PDF/打印输出（无客户端格式化能力）</li>\n<li>服务端渲染的 HTML 页面</li>\n<li>导出的 CSV/Excel 文件</li>\n<li>Push 通知文本</li>\n</ul>\n<p>后端格式化使用 ICU NumberFormatter 或等效实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Java：ICU NumberFormatter（推荐替代 DecimalFormat）&#10;import com.ibm.icu.number.NumberFormatter;&#10;import com.ibm.icu.number.LocalizedNumberFormatter;&#10;&#10;LocalizedNumberFormatter fmt = NumberFormatter.withLocale(Locale.GERMANY)&#10;    .unit(Currency.getInstance(&quot;EUR&quot;))&#10;    .precision(Precision.currency(CurrencyUsage.STANDARD));&#10;&#10;String result = fmt.format(1234567.89).toString();&#10;// → &quot;1.234.567,89 €&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Java：ICU NumberFormatter（推荐替代 DecimalFormat）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> com.ibm.icu.number.NumberFormatter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> com.ibm.icu.number.LocalizedNumberFormatter;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">LocalizedNumberFormatter fmt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NumberFormatter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">withLocale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Locale.GERMANY)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Currency.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getInstance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">precision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Precision.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(CurrencyUsage.STANDARD));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">String result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">format</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1234567.89</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toString</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// → \"1.234.567,89 €\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"百分比与单位格式化\">百分比与单位格式化</h2><p>百分比的 locale 差异：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Locale</th>\n<th>0.1523 显示为</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>en-US</td>\n<td>15.23%</td>\n<td>符号紧跟数字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fr-FR</td>\n<td>15,23 %</td>\n<td>符号前有空格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>tr-TR</td>\n<td>%15,23</td>\n<td>符号在前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ar-SA</td>\n<td>١٥٫٢٣٪</td>\n<td>阿拉伯数字 + 阿拉伯百分号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>度量单位同样有 locale 特定的格式化规则：温度（°C vs °F）、距离（km vs mi）、重量（kg vs lb）。CLDR 的 units 数据覆盖了 locale 到首选单位系统的映射。后端存储始终使用国际单位制（SI），展示时按 locale 转换：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>display</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>SI_value</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>conversion_factor</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>locale_unit_preference</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{display} = \\text{SI\\_value} \\times \\text{conversion\\_factor}(\\text{locale\\_unit\\_preference})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">display</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SI_value</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">conversion_factor</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">locale_unit_preference</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"货币符号的位置与间距\">货币符号的位置与间距</h2><p>货币符号的放置规则因 locale 而异，且与数字格式化密切相关：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Locale</th>\n<th>格式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>en-US</td>\n<td>$1,234.56</td>\n<td>符号在前，无空格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>de-DE</td>\n<td>1.234,56 €</td>\n<td>符号在后，有空格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>fr-FR</td>\n<td>1 234,56 €</td>\n<td>符号在后，narrow no-break space</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ja-JP</td>\n<td>¥1,234</td>\n<td>符号在前，无小数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ar-SA</td>\n<td>١٬٢٣٤٫٥٦ ر.س.</td>\n<td>阿拉伯数字 + 缩写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意空格类型：法语使用的是 narrow no-break space（U+202F），而非普通空格——这防止金额在换行时被分割。后端格式化时必须使用正确的 Unicode 空格字符。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Raw: {amount: 123456, currency: USD}&quot;] --&gt; B{Format for locale}&#10;    B --&gt;|en-US| C[&quot;$1,234.56&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|de-DE| D[&quot;1.234,56 $&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|ja-JP| E[&quot;$1,235&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|ar-SA| F[&quot;١٬٢٣٤٫٥٦ US$&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Raw: {amount: 123456, currency: USD}\"] --&gt; B{Format for locale}\n    B --&gt;|en-US| C[\"$1,234.56\"]\n    B --&gt;|de-DE| D[\"1.234,56 $\"]\n    B --&gt;|ja-JP| E[\"$1,235\"]\n    B --&gt;|ar-SA| F[\"١٬٢٣٤٫٥٦ US$\"]</pre><h2 id=\"舍入与银行家舍入\">舍入与银行家舍入</h2><p>金融计算中的舍入模式选择影响结果的公平性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>2.5 →</th>\n<th>3.5 →</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>HALF_UP（四舍五入）</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>向上偏移，累计误差为正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HALF_DOWN</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>向下偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HALF_EVEN（银行家舍入）</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>向最近偶数舍入，统计无偏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CEILING</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>总向正无穷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLOOR</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>总向负无穷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>银行家舍入（HALF_EVEN）</strong> 是金融行业标准——当值恰好在两个可能的舍入结果中间时，选择使最后一位为偶数的方向。这确保大量计算的累计误差趋近于零。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from decimal import Decimal, ROUND_HALF_EVEN&#10;&#10;amount = Decimal(&quot;10.255&quot;)&#10;rounded = amount.quantize(Decimal(&quot;0.01&quot;), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)&#10;# → Decimal(&quot;10.26&quot;)（5 前面是 2，奇数，向上进位使其变偶）&#10;&#10;amount2 = Decimal(&quot;10.245&quot;)&#10;rounded2 = amount2.quantize(Decimal(&quot;0.01&quot;), rounding=ROUND_HALF_EVEN)&#10;# → Decimal(&quot;10.24&quot;)（5 前面是 4，偶数，保持不变）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decimal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decimal, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND_HALF_EVEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decimal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.255\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rounded </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount.quantize(Decimal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rounding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND_HALF_EVEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → Decimal(\"10.26\")（5 前面是 2，奇数，向上进位使其变偶）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">amount2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decimal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.245\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rounded2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> amount2.quantize(Decimal(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rounding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ROUND_HALF_EVEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># → Decimal(\"10.24\")（5 前面是 4，偶数，保持不变）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>后端 API 文档应明确声明使用的舍入模式。不同的舍入策略会导致客户端计算的结果与后端不一致——这在电商结账页面是常见的用户投诉来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"api-中的金额表示\">API 中的金额表示</h2><p>对外 API 传输货币金额时需要无歧义的格式。两种主流方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符串 decimal</td>\n<td><code>{&quot;amount&quot;: &quot;123.45&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;}</code></td>\n<td>精度无损</td>\n<td>需要解析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最小单位整数</td>\n<td><code>{&quot;amount_minor&quot;: 12345, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot;}</code></td>\n<td>无歧义</td>\n<td>需知 minor units</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stripe 使用最小单位整数方案（<code>amount: 12345</code> = $123.45）；PayPal 使用字符串 decimal 方案。两者都避免了 JSON 中 <code>float</code> 的精度问题——JSON 的 number 类型在解析时可能损失精度（JavaScript <code>Number</code> 只有 53 位有效精度）。</p>\n<p>无论选择哪种方案，<code>currency</code> 字段必须始终伴随 <code>amount</code>——脱离币种的金额是无意义的。关于数字在不同 locale 下排序行为的差异，参见<a href=\"collation-sorting-search\">排序规则与搜索</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>货币与数字格式化的后端策略归结为三条：存储用整数（消除浮点）、传输用字符串或最小单位整数（消除精度损失）、格式化在输出层按 locale 执行（消除硬编码格式）。银行家舍入保证大规模计算的公平性，ICU NumberFormatter 处理各 locale 的分组符/小数符/符号位置差异。多币种系统同时保留原始金额、汇率快照和结算金额，确保财务可追溯。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"货币与数字格式化","id":"货币与数字格式化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"货币存储：最小单位整数","id":"货币存储-最小单位整数"},{"level":2,"text":"多币种系统的数据模型","id":"多币种系统的数据模型"},{"level":2,"text":"数字格式化的 locale 差异","id":"数字格式化的-locale-差异"},{"level":2,"text":"百分比与单位格式化","id":"百分比与单位格式化"},{"level":2,"text":"货币符号的位置与间距","id":"货币符号的位置与间距"},{"level":2,"text":"舍入与银行家舍入","id":"舍入与银行家舍入"},{"level":2,"text":"API 中的金额表示","id":"api-中的金额表示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时区与日期时间处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/timezone-datetime-handling"},"next":{"title":"排序规则与搜索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/data-handling/collation-sorting-search"}}